WEBVTT

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:01.160
leading from a place
of values and principles,

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:04.900
and leading from that place,
and staying true to yourself.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:07.791
And so some might say,
"Well, you're in an elected position.

00:03:07.791 --> 00:03:08.920
What do you mean?"

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:10.900
Yes, I hear you.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:13.240
There's some irony in that.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:15.010
But let me explain.

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.290
Contribution is the most important thing.

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:21.100
For me, joining an executive
of predominantly men,

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.820
creating a space in my office

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:26.280
where other indigenous
women could learn and lead,

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.750
it was all about creating that space,

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:32.340
and by celebrating
and acknowledging and contributing.